  "description": {
    "zh-CN": "Virtual Patient V4 体素诊所的数据移植：疗愈花园中的单栋诊所（接诊室、检验室、影像室、病理室、诊所走廊与会诊区），保留 V4 的大门、窗户、天窗、吊灯、标牌、三台工作站及其检查能力分组、会诊证据板、解剖图谱台、书架、花园长椅、池塘、树木、花丛、远景山丘、建造园地与园地工作台。坐标与 V4 源码一致。",
    "en": "Data port of the Virtual Patient V4 voxel clinic: a single clinic building (consultation, laboratory, imaging, pathology, corridor and case-conference area) in a healing garden, keeping V4's doors, windows, skylight, ceiling lamps, signs, the three workstations with their investigation groupings, evidence board, anatomy atlas kiosk, bookshelves, garden benches, pond, trees, flowers, horizon hills, the building garden and its workbench. Coordinates match the V4 source."
  },
